{
  "_comment": "Scripted eval conversations. The clock is pinned to Friday 2026-11-20 10:00 (Europe/Istanbul), so 'yarın' = Sat 21, 'pazartesi' = Mon 23, 'perşembe' = Thu 26. Field expectations: a string must match exactly, {\"contains_any\": [...]} is a case-insensitive substring match, null means the field must NOT be saved. reply_contains is a list of groups; each group needs at least one match.",
